# The seventh tooling step, the runs part: `ci --tiers --compare --os both` and
# a `try` run as a source, `ci-times --ab`'s detail, `ci-times --section` and
# `--heading`, and `try-result`. Written with the code, and run with
# `cargo xtask mutate tooling-7-runs`.

# ------------------------------------------------------- the reports it reads

